silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#storagelegarrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.01_storage_not_identity.concrete_anchor#storagelegarrow" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#storagelegarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The StorageLegArrow is the storage-leg morphism from the Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a (the Tartu vet-record payload) to the Mittens apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'sigma', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#icechunkchunkc0x7f4a a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.01_storage_not_identity.concrete_anchor#icechunkchunkc0x7f4a" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#icechunkchunkc0x7f4a silm:hasLongDescription "The IcechunkChunkC0x7f4a is the specific Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a storing the Tartu vet-record payload for Mittens, dated 2026-05-18, with hash sha256:7f4a...bf2c. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'GraniteRow_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#storageprofileonly a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.01_storage_not_identity.concrete_anchor#storageprofileonly" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#storageprofileonly silm:hasLongDescription "The StorageProfileOnly is the Hom-profile of the storage row: only arrows that terminate at a storage node in M_Granite (manifest entries, hash records, version snapshots). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Hom_storage', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#fullmittensprofile a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.01_storage_not_identity.concrete_anchor#fullmittensprofile" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#fullmittensprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The FullMittensProfile is the full Hom-profile of Mittens: type arrow (to Cat), domestic-cat refinement, taxonomy-source (to Felis catus/TSN 183798), evidence arrows (from vet records), quality arrows (body mass 4.3 kg), process arrows (vet exam), role arrows (clinic patient), storage arrow, validation arrows." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#vetcareplanrecord77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.01_storage_not_identity.concrete_anchor#vetcareplanrecord77" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_concrete_anchor#vetcareplanrecord77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetCarePlanRecord77 is the clinical care plan record 77 generated for Mittens at the May 2026 vet visit at the Tartu Animal Clinic — the concrete competing cocone that receives the universal mediator from Mittens but not from the storage row." .
